"""roulette: a terminal roulette wheel of harmless, read-only commands.

Type ``roulette`` and watch a reel of shell commands scroll past a pointer,
slow down, and land on one -- which then gets executed. Every command in the
wheel is read-only and non-destructive (listing files, showing the date,
reporting disk usage, and so on), so a spin can never hurt your system.
"""

